## Assemble the concentric shafts

![Step12](youtube:w-7CUQz9Fog)

- Apply the medium concentric brass rod assembly inside the large brass tube, with the small gear resting on top of the large center gear. 
- Apply the smallest concentric brass rod inside the medium rod, forming triple-concentric shafts, with the small gear resting on top of the other small gear.
- The medium brass shaft should protrude out the end of the large brass shaft
- The small brass shaft should protrude out the end of the medium brass shaft
- Both small center gears should align with the teeth from a sector arc 

